<title>USA: Allstate expands stock repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Allstate expands stock repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allstate Corp said Tuesday that its board of directors authorized the expansion of its stock repurchase plan by up to $750 million through the end of 1997.</p>
<p>Before the expansion, 4.8 million shares had been repurchased, an Allstate spokeswoman said. The board had previously approved the repurchase of shares to meet the obligations of the company's employee stock options plan, she said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
